        "反正切函数原函数"
      ],
      "question_type": "基础积分计算",
      "method": [
        "直接用arctan公式"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "用一般公式π/t代入t=2"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "poisson_kernel_limit",
        "template": "计算∫1/(t²+x²)dx在具体t值下的广义积分",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 4,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "求解",
          "steps": [
            "由一般公式$\\int_{-\\infty}^\\infty\\frac1{t^2+x^2}dx=\\pi/t$，取$t=2$得$\\pi/2$。",
            "验证：直接积分$\\frac12\\arctan(x/2)\\Big|_{-\\infty}^\\infty=\\frac12\\left(\\frac\\pi2-\\left(-\\frac\\pi2\\right)\\right)=\\frac\\pi2$，一致。"
          ]
        }
