      "id": "isct-2021-df5ee26269-q04-practice-01",
      "school": "东京科学大学",
      "year": "2021"
    },
    {
      "text": "求$\\displaystyle\\lim_{t\\to0^+}\\int_1^2\\frac{t}{t^2+x^2}dx$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "含参数积分的极限",
        "0不在区间内的估计"
      ],
      "question_type": "极限计算",
      "method": [
        "直接计算与不等式估计两种方法验证"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "直接用arctan计算",
        "用不等式估计验证极限为0"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "poisson_kernel_limit",
        "template": "0不在积分区间内时核函数积分的极限",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "求解",
          "steps": [
            "直接计算：$\\int_1^2\\frac{t}{t^2+x^2}dx=\\arctan(2/t)-\\arctan(1/t)$。当$t\\to0^+$，$2/t,1/t\\to+\\infty$，两个反正切都趋于$\\pi/2$，故差$\\to0$。",
            "不等式验证：x≥1，故$\\frac{t}{t^2+x^2}\\le\\frac t{x^2}\\le t$，积分$\\le t\\cdot(2-1)=t\\to0$，与直接计算一致，极限为0。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "isct-2021-df5ee26269-q04-practice-02",
      "school": "东京科学大学",
      "year": "2021"
    },
    {
      "text": "计算$\\displaystyle\\lim_{t\\to0^+}\\int_{-1}^{2}\\frac{t}{t^2+x^2}dx$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "0在区间内部时核函数积分的极限",
        "反正切函数极限"
      ],
      "question_type": "极限计算",
      "method": [
        "直接用arctan计算"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "写出原函数表达式",
        "代入极限t→0+"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "poisson_kernel_limit",
        "template": "0∈(a,b)时核函数t/(t²+x²)积分的极限为π",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "求解",
          "steps": [
            "直接计算：$\\int_{-1}^2\\frac{t}{t^2+x^2}dx=\\arctan(2/t)-\\arctan(-1/t)=\\arctan(2/t)+\\arctan(1/t)$。",
            "当$t\\to0^+$，$2/t,1/t\\to+\\infty$，故两项都趋于$\\pi/2$，和$\\to\\pi$。",
            "这正是原题结论(3)在$f(x)\\equiv1$时的特例：$\\pi f(0)=\\pi\\cdot1=\\pi$，验证一致。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "isct-2021-df5ee26269-q04-practice-03",
      "school": "东京科学大学",
      "year": "2021"
    },
    {
      "text": "设$f(x)=x^2+1$，求$\\displaystyle\\lim_{t\\to0^+}\\int_{-1}^1\\frac{t}{t^2+x^2}f(x)\\,dx$，并用直接计算验证等于$\\pi f(0)$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "泊松核逼近定理的应用",
        "含参数积分的分拆估计"
      ],
      "question_type": "综合验证题",
      "method": [
        "直接拆分计算并与一般结论比较"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "利用一般结论预测极限值",
        "将积分拆成两部分直接计算验证"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "poisson_kernel_limit",
        "template": "对具体连续函数验证泊松核逼近定理∫t/(t²+x²)f(x)dx→πf(0)",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "求解",
          "steps": [
            "由一般结论(3)（0∈(-1,1)），极限应等于$\\pi f(0)=\\pi(0^2+1)=\\pi$。",
            "直接验证：拆分$\\int_{-1}^1\\frac{t}{t^2+x^2}(x^2+1)dx=\\int_{-1}^1\\frac{t}{t^2+x^2}dx+\\int_{-1}^1\\frac{tx^2}{t^2+x^2}dx$。",
            "第一项：$\\arctan(1/t)-\\arctan(-1/t)=2\\arctan(1/t)\\to2\\cdot\\frac\\pi2=\\pi$（$t\\to0^+$）。",
            "第二项：因$\\frac{tx^2}{t^2+x^2}=t-\\frac{t^3}{t^2+x^2}\\le t$对$x\\in[-1,1]$一致成立，故$\\int_{-1}^1\\frac{tx^2}{t^2+x^2}dx\\le2t\\to0$。",
            "综合得极限$=\\pi+0=\\pi$，与步骤1预测一致，验证成功。"
          ]
        }
      ],
